\begin{equation}
 \vec{E}_\mathrm{Array} = \sum\limits_{n=1}^{N} a_n \vec{E}_{\mathrm{EEP},n}.
\end{equation}
Here, $a_n$ are the complex weighting coefficients of the individual antenna ports which are determined based on the algorithm shown in \cref{sec:bf_algorithm}. This method is in line with well-established concepts for the synthesis of total array patterns, compare \cite{Kelley1993} and is frequently used to determine the radiation characteristics of complete arrays \cite{Kasemodel2013,Yetisir2016}. 
